vsnvr-models
Model files redistributed by Virtual Shield Systems for VS-NVR.

Virtual Shield Systems did not create or train these models. Each was published
by its authors under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE), and is
redistributed here under that license. The authors' copyrights are retained.

Changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)): files marked "converted" below were changed
by Virtual Shield Systems from the published checkpoint, as described for each.
Files marked "unmodified" are byte-identical to the upstream file.

Release aidetect-models-v1
==========================

rtdetr-v2-r18-coco-6436e6ac.onnx  (converted)
  Model:    RT-DETRv2-S. Code: https://github.com/lyuwenyu/RT-DETR
  Upstream: https://huggingface.co/PekingU/rtdetr_v2_r18vd
            revision 5650961749fa93567c0d46fc7f43ea4f9e914107
  License:  Apache-2.0
  Changes:  exported from PyTorch to ONNX (opset 17, 640x640, FP32); the box
            output is scaled to pixels and a sigmoid applied to the class
            logits, and both are concatenated into one [1, 300, 84] tensor.
  Data:     trained on COCO 2017 only (https://cocodataset.org; annotations
            CC BY 4.0, images subject to their Flickr terms), from a
            ResNet18-vd backbone pretrained by PaddleClas on ImageNet-1k
            (https://www.image-net.org).

plate-rtdetr-v2-r18-50f9bf9d.onnx  (unmodified)
  Model:    RT-DETRv2-R18 license-plate detector
  Upstream: https://huggingface.co/Topurrra/rtdetr-license-plate-detection-onnx
            revision aecb24a78e31cea03f59b83156d55dde84f20d94, file plate_rtdetr.onnx
  License:  Apache-2.0
  Data:     fine-tuned from PekingU/rtdetr_v2_r18vd (COCO, as above) on the
            Open Images V7 "Vehicle registration plate" class
            (https://storage.googleapis.com/openimages/web/index.html):
            annotations by Google LLC under CC BY 4.0; images listed as
            CC BY 2.0 by their Flickr authors, which Google advises verifying
            per image.

